      "review_description": "My experience with Marshall Energy Solutions was terrible. Communication was almost nonexistent—they didn’t reply to my emails for weeks and ignored my messages. He even had an important email from AusNet Services about my export application sitting in their spam folder for nearly a month! I only heard from them because my SolarVIC application was about to expire.To make things worse, they submitted the wrong documents with 0kw export, instead of 5kw export to AusNet Services and my retailer, causing delays and money back in my pocket. I had to spend a lot of my time chasing up AusNet Services and my retailer to fix their mistakes. I even questioned my export before the forms were submitted! I started this application at the start of the year, and i've only now just fixed everything.The only ok part of this whole process was the installer, but that doesn’t make up for everything else that went wrong. I wouldn’t recommend Marshall Energy Solutions to anyone looking for reliable service.",
